Added `app.extend()`, which provides an easy way to update certain properties of a setting.
Example:
```
app.set('foo', { 'bar' : 1 })
app.extend('foo', { 'baz' : 1 });
app.get('foo');
// => { "bar" : 1, "baz" : 1 }
```

